+### 15.5 WP-6f private state, policy and authority (merged v8 architecture)
 
 The approved §15.4 face/scene-text policy is implemented as three separately reviewed packages: private database authority (WP-6fA), detector/worker/private human CLI (WP-6fB), and release enforcement (WP-6fC). v8 supplies implementation detail, not detector selection, license approval, calibrated performance, capture opening or production permission. The independent global photo-publication gate defaults closed. Screening may run privately under a configured benchmark policy while publication remains closed; a passing screen or human decision cannot open that gate.
 
